OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with clear spells
OL,7,Fand light winds. Staying dry for
OL,8,FShetland overnight but clouding over
OL,9,Ffor Orkney with a few showers.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FDry start with bright spells
OL,12,Ffor Shetland, then a few showers in
OL,13,Fthe afternoon. Mostly cloudy for
OL,14,FOrkney with scattered showers and
OL,15,Ffreshening easterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
