OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FEasterly winds Wednesday turning
OL,7,Fnortherly and continuing to push a mix
OL,8,Fof scattered showers and brighter
OL,9,Fspells across the Northern Isles
OL,10,Fthrough the outlook period, wintry for
OL,11,Fa time Friday.
